WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.743 --> 00:00:03.118
SAM WILSON
These guys use brute force.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.780
They're strong.

00:00:05.227 --> 00:00:06.065
Too strong.

00:00:06.665 --> 00:00:08.243
SAM WILSON
They might be a part of the Big Three.

00:00:08.243 --> 00:00:09.176
BUCKY BARNES
What Big Three?

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:11.176
SAM WILSON
Androids, aliens, and wizards.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.092
BUCKY BARNES
That's not a thing.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:12.907
SAM WILSON
That's... That's definitely a thing.

00:00:12.907 --> 00:00:14.014
BUCKY BARNES
No, it's not.

00:00:20.021 --> 00:00:21.076
BUCKY BARNES
There are no wizards.

00:00:21.076 --> 00:00:21.941
SAM WILSON
Doctor Strange.

00:00:21.966 --> 00:00:22.670
BUCKY BARNES
...is a sorcerer.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.195
SAM WILSON
A sorcerer is a wizard without a hat.

